                                "sense_id": "e5048dd8-d932-313c-abf1-03863df28c93",
                                "text": "For they singe such a Genethliacon and byrth verse as was neuer heard of before in the worlde."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7d1cc841-62bc-4a6e-9cf5-a53a98e8ab06",
                                "sense_id": "e5048dd8-d932-313c-abf1-03863df28c93",
                                "text": "Others for magnificence at the natiuities of Princes children, or by custome used yearely upon the same dayes, are called songs natall or Genethliaca."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
